OL,3,GNEWSATeen who murdered boy over #20
OL,4,Adebt jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who murdered a 16-year-old
OL,7,Fboy in East Sussex over a #20 cannabis
OL,8,Fdebt has been jailed for 14 years.
OL,10,FJoshua Ingram was attacked with a 19cm
OL,11,F(7.5 inch) combat-style knife at
OL,12,FSeaford railway station in East Sussex
OL,13,Fon 10 September, 2025.
OL,15,FAt Hove Crown Court on Friday, Joshua's
OL,16,Fkiller, who cannot be named due to his
OL,17,Fage, was told he must serve a minimum
OL,18,Fterm of 14 years, and will be on
OL,19,Flicence for the rest of his life.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
