OL,3,GNEWSATeen who murdered boy over #20
OL,4,Adebt jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FSentencing the teenager, Judge Mr
OL,7,FJustice Bourne said: "You know what you
OL,8,Fdid was utterly appalling. Josh was a
OL,9,Fpopular young man with his life in
OL,10,Ffront of him. He did nothing to deserve
OL,11,Fhaving his life taken away."
